<urn:atm:triage:finding/ARCH-003>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "ARCH-003" ;
  triage:title "ADR pin requires a package reference later sprints forbid" ;
  triage:description "The ADR-005 bullet that d.1 will paste says project files must repeat the System.CommandLine version and the TFM. d.3 allows the package reference only on dotnet/src/Docli/Docli.csproj and forbids it on Docli.Tests. d.4 and d.5 forbid a direct System.CommandLine package reference on Docli.Tool and Docli.Sample. Those project files cannot both repeat the package version and omit the package reference." ;
